flowchart LR
  Request --> Intent[Intent + context]
  Intent --> Catalog[Exact SQL search]
  Catalog --> Approx[Approximate alternatives\nnot orderable]
  Catalog --> RxGate
  RxGate -- Rx --> PrescriptionLead
  RxGate -- OTC --> Confirmation --> Details[Name + phone + address]
  Details --> CreateOrder --> Transaction[price + stock + order] --> Result
